{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20009","headline":"鵶路溪行呈陆中丞 · 孟郊","name":"鵶路溪行呈陆中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鵶路不可越，三十六渡溪。\n有物饮碧水，高林挂青蜺。\n历览道更险，驱使迹频暌。\n视听易常主，心魂互相迷。\n浪石忽摇动，沙堤信难跻。\n危峰紫霄外，古木浮云齐。\n出阻望汝郡，大贤多招携。\n疲马恋旧秣，羁禽思故栖。\n应怜泣楚玉，弃置如尘泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}